  <informations>Unofficial simplified front illustration redrawn from official MDT photograph https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/user_upload/_processed_/6/c/csm_AZI-0616-03_F_1f53cff89c.png. Clear native regular Arial text, not pixel-traced lettering. This is an approximate layout, not a dimensionally/detail-exact manufacturer CAD conversion; pin details omitted. Front nominal envelope 144 x 90 mm, 2 drawing units/mm. No electrical connection terminals. Product source: https://www.mdt.de/produkte/produktdetail/aktorik/schaltaktoren/schaltaktor-azi-mit-wirkleistungsmessung-serie-03.html</informations>
